The admitted-retry case passes in both event orders, but I reproduced a related defect when the retry’s receipt is also lost. If its transcript entry arrives first, the UI keeps two “Not confirmed” records; if the unknown outcome arrives first, it keeps one. The difference persists after remount and leaves a delivered message falsely unresolved.
